# Kamil — .gitignore
#
# NOTE: this file was previously corrupted — a UTF-16 block had been pasted into
# the middle of it, which made git treat the whole file as binary and silently
# ignore EVERY rule in it. That is how a private key and Adnan's personal memory
# ended up tracked in what is now a public repository. Keep this file plain UTF-8.
#
# Rule of thumb: this repo holds CODE. Everything Kamil learns, hears, sees or
# downloads lives under data/ or models/ and never gets committed.

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# ── Virtual environments ───────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
venv313/
tts_env/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# ── Secrets and credentials (NEVER commit) ─────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
*.crt
id_rsa*
credentials*
secrets.*
# Retired key/cert material. *.key would miss a name like
# "kamil.key.replaced-20261116", so exclude the whole shape too -- a rotated
# private key must never be one `git add -A` away from a public push.
*.replaced-*
*.bak
*.old

# ── Local state: everything Kamil knows ────────────────────────────
# All of data/ is machine-local. It holds identity, voiceprints, conversation
# history, drift metrics, indexed copies of private repos and webcam footage.
data/

# ── Models and voices (huge, redistributable elsewhere) ────────────
models/*.gguf
models/whisper-large-v3/
models/**/*.bin
models/**/*.safetensors
voices/*.onnx
voices/*.bin

# ── Webcam recordings (room watcher) ───────────────────────────────
# Belt and braces: data/ already covers these, but footage of a room must never
# reach a public repo even if someone relocates the clip directory.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
room/
room_events.db

# ── Audio samples / voice fixtures ─────────────────────────────────
*.wav
*.webm
*.flac

# ── Databases ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/

# ── Node (Electron shell, eMCP bridge, VS Code extension) ──────────
node_modules/
out/
*.vsix
kamil/

# ── Editors / IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.vs/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── OS cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Scratch test scripts at the repo root (not the pytest suite) ───
# tests/ IS tracked; these root-level ad-hoc scripts are not.
/test_client.py
/test_indexer.py
/test_parser.py

# ── Embedded checkouts of other projects (not submodules) ──────────
# These are reference/scratch clones that live here for convenience; committing
# them as gitlinks would give anyone cloning Kamil a broken, unfetchable pointer.
code13/Kootlipi/
reference/

# ── Kamil's scratch workspace ──────────────────────────────────────
# This is the agent's write root: files Kamil creates while working. Local only.
workspace/
